label story_04_fail (Roots Beneath Blackwater Failed)
[style name="Gameplay"]
"Dianthus Core" (Default): Blackwater has gone still. The old road sank before it could show its stones.
"Dianthus Core": I felt the forest close over it, root by root, like a wound pulling shut around a thorn it could not remove.
"Dianthus Core": Do not spend your strength on regret, little alchemist. Regret does not grow roots. Plant, forge, and keep the Core breathing through the nights that remain.
